WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.533 --> 00:00:04.113
Zacatecas... the night before the battle.

2
00:00:04.937 --> 00:00:11.397
Ángeles has moved his guns, in secret, to the north, between the city and Vetagrande.

3
00:00:15.062 --> 00:00:17.912
June twenty-third... ten o'clock.

4
00:00:21.075 --> 00:00:22.595
Fire!

